#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:5
#: 12609aba1f0146a882c91b2a28eada23
msgid "Hexsoon 24G Radar"
msgstr "Hexsoon 24G 雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:7
#: d4bfcc792d254d5a878aa1384569deba
msgid ""
"The `Hexsoon 24G radar <http://www.hexsoon.com/en/list-4-27.html>`__ "
"(available in `20m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-96-167.html>`__, `100m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-88-685.html>`__, and `200m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-85-346.html>`__ versions) are "
"24Ghz-band radar useful for :ref:`surface tracking <copter:terrain-"
"following-manual-modes>`, :ref:`terrain following <copter:terrain-"
"following>` and :ref:`object avoidance <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`"
msgstr ""
"`Hexsoon 24G 雷达 <http://www.hexsoon.com/en/list-4-27.html>`__（提供 `20m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-96-167.html>`__、`100m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-88-685.html>`__ 和 `200m "
"<http://www.hexsoon.com/en/product/product-85-346.html>`__ 版本）是 24GHz "
"频段雷达，适用于 :ref:`地面跟踪 <copter:terrain-following-manual-modes>`、:ref:`地形跟随 "
"<copter:terrain-following>` 和 :ref:`避障 <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:15
#: 1f3c8284631f41699a679aeb402cddd6
msgid "ArduPilot only supports the CAN versions of these sensors"
msgstr "ArduPilot 仅支持这些传感器的 CAN 版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:19
#: 22380a9566c04c03ad3ed37fe2bcb1e9
msgid "Support is available in ArduPilot versions 4.6 and higher"
msgstr "ArduPilot 4.6 及更高版本提供支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:22
#: 66940268f6f34fe2980c3e597c53c2f3
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:24
#: cc6f7374c15a4e26acfcc8753f0fdb26
msgid ""
"Mount the radar to the vehicle so that the radar points downwards and "
"connect to one of the autopilot's CAN ports as shown below"
msgstr "将雷达安装到飞行器上，使雷达朝下，并按下图所示连接到飞控的 CAN 接口之一"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:30
#: 14efb7773d7a4d4c8a5fb5c43ef80c6b
msgid "Set the following parameters assuming the sensor is connected to CAN1"
msgstr "假设传感器连接到 CAN1，设置以下参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:32
#: e45ef9c6e9c84e15b9e81a8af8e5e5de
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First CAN driver)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一路 CAN 驱动）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:33
#: 99660da7626d4a81ae34b20470b5f4b5
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE <CAN_P1_BITRATE>` = 500000"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE <CAN_P1_BITRATE>` = 500000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:34
#: 33f60b00f1d94a25b7bad2d4879bda57
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 14 (RadarCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 14（RadarCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:35
#: 3facdcf8ebba434f93dd1251306cb41c
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 44 (HexsoonRadar)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 44（HexsoonRadar）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:36
#: d792306101c84414aa2df1b6d7f8c2e4
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 18 (meters), 95 (meters) or 190 (meters) "
"depending upon the model (this is the maximum range of the radar minus a few"
" meters of buffer)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 18（米）、95（米）或 "
"190（米），取决于型号（此值为雷达最大量程减去几米的缓冲）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:37
#: deba811cbbba44d28097a75e64ac2f9d
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.5 (0.5m minimum range)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.5（最小量程 0.5m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:38
#: 91bb8f39b0e34c71bc6031e393e7700f
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_RECV_ID <RNGFND1_RECV_ID>` = 0 (ID of the sensor, 0 to accept "
"all CAN ids for distance)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_RECV_ID <RNGFND1_RECV_ID>` = 0（传感器 ID，0 表示接受所有 CAN ID 的距离数据）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:42
#: 0a6348f2fe8b40719d2bbe8113964d63
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently support the same type of CAN rangefinders "
"connected to different CAN ports. If you would like to use multiple CAN "
"rangefinders together, connect them to the same CAN port."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 目前不支持将相同类型的 CAN 测距仪连接到不同的 CAN 接口。如果需要同时使用多个 CAN 测距仪，请将它们连接到同一个 CAN"
" 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:45
#: 239e58f57d4a47e7aa161171d887db46
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-hexsoon-24g.rst:47
#: 3ed7da3f17cb49a79b49090f8655df10
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请关注「rangefinder1」。"
